truct |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- *(this+0x8) 0x0..0x14: written per-vertex during batch fill\n- this 0x4: incremented by 3 per vertex added; persists across calls\n- this 0x8: points to dynamically filled buffer\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0059e43c | flt_59E43C | R | physics constant [DERIVED] (also: float threshold for contact aging overflow) |\n| 0059e440 | flt_59E440 | R | ZeroThreshold (~0.0f, physics clamp) [DERIVED] |\n| 0059e448 | flt_59E448 | R | TileSteppingMultiplier [DERIVED] |\n| 0059e5fc | flt_59E5FC | R | FrameRateCorrectionFactor [DERIVED] (also: global frame-rate correction) |\n| 008b8f24 | dword_8B8F24 | R | D3DDeviceWrapperPtr [DERIVED] (also: D3D device wrapper / scene manager singleton vtable) |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n\n**Guard conditions (deterministic — field vs literal):**\n\n| Base | Offset | Test | Value | Field / meaning |\n|------|--------|------|-------|-----------------|\n| *(this+0x20) | 0x0 | < | 1023 | Max batch entry limit — blocks if >= 1023 |\n| this | 0x4 | < | 2045 | Max vertex count (3 per entry) — blocks if >= 2045 |\n\n**Guard interpretation:** Both guards must pass for vertex data to be appended. *(this+0x20)[0] < 1023 limits total batch entries; this[1] < 2045 limits total vertex slots (3 per entry = 1023*3/3).\n"
